` FLAME logsource mapping -- field names, index, and sourcetype require environment-specific tuning. `

file_path IN ("*\\Login Data", "*\\Login Data-journal", "*\\logins.json", "*\\key4.db", "*\\key3.db", "*\\signons.sqlite") file_access_type IN ("*read*", "*open*") NOT (process_name IN ("*\\chrome.exe", "*\\firefox.exe", "*\\msedge.exe", "*\\brave.exe", "*\\opera.exe", "*\\vivaldi.exe")) NOT (process_name IN ("*antivirus*", "*defender*", "*security*"))
